// The people of the village: who they are, how they look (see
// characters.ron for the skins), which house in village.ron is theirs,
// which shop they keep, and what they do through the day.
//
// A day is a list of slots from one time to another. The first slot that
// fits the moment holds: `on` limits it to weekdays, `seasons` to seasons,
// `rain: true` to rainy days and `rain: false` to dry ones. When no slot
// fits, the villager is at home. `At` names a spot in village.ron;
// `Stroll` walks from each listed spot to the next, around and around.
(
    villagers: [
        (
            id: "hester",
            name: "Hester Brambly",
            look: (body: "body-fair.png", outfit: "outfit-dress.png", hair: "hair-bun.png", hair_color: (0.55, 0.3, 0.12)),
            home: "brambly_house",
            keeps: Some("tavern"),
            day: [
                (from: "06:30", to: "09:00", at: At("garden_east"), rain: false),
                (from: "09:30", to: "23:00", at: At("tavern_counter")),
            ],
